sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila succini Turing wavenumber at 2.8 µm (44 Ma, detail scale s0) — MorphoEval overall 76.8/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics and the Turing wavenumber at 2.759e-06 m for Drosophila succini at 44 Ma. The dispersion band already fits, but this scoring withholds specimen and sweep credit until the sidecar and the image-fitness test exist. Overall is the rubric weighted mean, not a separate number. Overall 76.8/100 (faithfulness 74.6, reproducibility 81.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 82, Morphological realism / specimen match 70, Parameter expressivity 72, Morphometric validation 74, Source and data traceability 80, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 82. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-succini-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 448421 B, 1512×1008 px, artifact_sha256 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584 (sha256 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584), spec_fingerprint f5b636dc6a95053a09da7fe5fd86461e841d4ca25eb9122e457e095b842aad73. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d5250d5d69797419c7dcbd44bd49a2f156290e47fdf9d65ee96983d3232db5d9; artifact_sha256: 8b3f9e4fcc75332bc97d3765fe96f67d99b1d3c05ae3318cd8eea040872fe584; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=e227ba771980817d..., datasets/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_succini_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=1a0de2972916cbfa...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952: a reaction-diffusion system selects a critical wavenumber. | Schnakenberg 1979: du/dt = a - u + u^2 v and dv/dt = b - u^2 v, plus diffusion. | Hennig 1965: Drosophila succini is a Baltic amber acalyptrate, volume 145. | Grimaldi 1987: Dominican amber drosophilids, the chronoseries context for the 19 Ma successor.; reconstructed_in_script: Jacobian, sigma(k), k_c = argmax sigma, D_u solved so lambda = 2.759e-06 m at r = 18.72. | Stem r = 8.40 below onset and equal-diffusivity ablation have sigma_max < 0. | Berryi wavelength 2.382 µm by transferring the registry ratio 98.43/114 onto this detail scale.; transfer_boundary: No published measurement of a 2.8 µm pigment wavelength in the Hennig holotype. | Kondo & Miura 2010 is a framework paper, not a datum for this fossil. | The gallery card is a synthetic spiral, not an amber photomicrograph.; does_not_claim: That the GIF's spot field is a photograph of Drosophila succini. | That the full Fourier spectrum of the nonlinear PDE matches linear theory (it does not, outside the Turing band). | That 10.1163/187631265X00018 is a resolvable DOI.." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=1.5]: Publish the band-restricted Pearson r and RMSE, and state the full-spectrum r so the band choice is not hidden.",
            "open need [parameter_sweep/parameter-expressivity, pressure P=1.3]: Tabulate lambda versus D_u at fixed r and confirm it is monotone in the measurements sidecar.",
            "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.5]: Segment the gallery card and report foreground fraction, coherency, circularity, and an orientation KS distance against the spot field, with value not equal to the reference.",
            "remediation needed: Add specimen segmentation metrics that are not self-referential.",
            "remediation needed: Add the D_u sweep monotonicity table to the scored measurements.",
            "remediation needed: Report Turing-band Pearson r and the weaker full-spectrum r side by side.",
            "remediation needed: Score the animated GIF against the specimen with the canonical CV function." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.768"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (loop 3172 builder-assessor, pass 1)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

